@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = tester@chaekdami.local
@password = password123
@nickname = tester

### 1. 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "nickname": "{{nickname}}"
}

### 2. 로그인 (accessToken 저장)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 3. 내 정보 조회 — GET /api/auth/me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. 내 정보 조회 — GET /api/me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 토큰 없이 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 6. 잘못된 토큰으로 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value

### 7. 짧은 비밀번호 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short-pw@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "ab12",
  "nickname": "short"
}

### 8. 문자 종류 1개 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "one-class@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "abcdefgh",
  "nickname": "oneclass"
}

### 9. 이메일 254자 초과 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "longmail"
}

### 10. 닉네임 1자 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nick@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "a"
}

### 11. 이미 가입된 이메일 — 409 EMAIL_ALREADY_EXISTS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "nickname": "{{nickname}}"
}

### 12. 틀린 비밀번호 — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 13. 비밀번호 공백 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "space@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "Pass word1",
  "nickname": "spaceuser"
}

### 14. 비밀번호 한글 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hangul-pw@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "비밀번호abc1",
  "nickname": "한글유저"
}

### 15. 사용 불가 특수문자 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "quote@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "Pass'word1",
  "nickname": "quoteuser"
}

### 16. 비밀번호가 닉네임과 같음 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "same-nick@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password1",
  "nickname": "password1"
}

### 17. 비밀번호가 이메일 아이디와 같음 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "password1@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password1",
  "nickname": "othername"
}

### 18. 닉네임 특수문자 — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nick-char@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "nick_name"
}

### 19. 대소문자만 다른 닉네임 — 409 NICKNAME_ALREADY_EXISTS
# 1번 가입(nickname=tester) 이후 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "other@chaekdami.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "Tester"
}
